            "is_free": false,
            "detailed_description": "Meet Hanzo. He’s a ninja. While he was training ‘out there’ the Pirate Monkey Zombies™ - stupid, ugly, smelly, rotten and disgusting creatures - kidnapped his family. Take control of his awesome blade and aid him in the quest to free them.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nYou need just a mouse to play. LMB + draw a line to jump, dash, dodge, and slash. RMB to summon powerful Ninjutsu Techniques - super-efficient against the 'rottents'.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nFEATURES:<br />\r\n• Unique mouse only controls<br />\r\n• Story Mode<br />\r\n• Challenges Mode<br />\r\n• Endless Arcade: Survival and Gatekeeper Modes<br />\r\n• Upgradeable Ninjutsu Techniques<br />\r\n<br />\r\nCut, slice, snip, sever, chop, shear and trim hordes of Pirate Monkey Zombies™.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nAnd wear a helmet - you got only one brain!",
            "about_the_game": "Meet Hanzo. He’s a ninja. While he was training ‘out there’ the Pirate Monkey Zombies™ - stupid, ugly, smelly, rotten and disgusting creatures - kidnapped his family. Take control of his awesome blade and aid him in the quest to free them.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nYou need just a mouse to play. LMB + draw a line to jump, dash, dodge, and slash. RMB to summon powerful Ninjutsu Techniques - super-efficient against the 'rottents'.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nFEATURES:<br />\r\n• Unique mouse only controls<br />\r\n• Story Mode<br />\r\n• Challenges Mode<br />\r\n• Endless Arcade: Survival and Gatekeeper Modes<br />\r\n• Upgradeable Ninjutsu Techniques<br />\r\n<br />\r\nCut, slice, snip, sever, chop, shear and trim hordes of Pirate Monkey Zombies™.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nAnd wear a helmet - you got only one brain!",
            "short_description": "Draw Slasher is the unique demanding and dynamic action packed beat'em up you need only a mouse to play. Cut, slice, snip, sever, chop, shear and trim hordes of Pirate Monkey Zombies™.",
